#: scenario4:scenario4_15CB16D0_E549_433B_9F2B_A0AE54A1DD91
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b2f87a323e93d1037a1883d053599a5034365fae338c731a6b922f6d2704474f
#. default-sha256: 9d3da15d388dd085a511fb7543edf088de2f246923a517a81f5365044f6af34c
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_15CB16D0_E549_433B_9F2B_A0AE54A1DD91"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫On his way back from the washroom several days later, Michel heard muffled voices."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫소녀가 쓰러진 지 며칠째가 되는 날, ⟪k:1⟫용변을 마치고 돌아가려던 미셸은 ⟪k:2⟫수상쩍은 목소리"
"를 들었습니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_EA5D1A03_3268_4A54_8101_886DD8F3E0E0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9a048c8c24ee7bda77498e6a8fd29c316de47de15698024631fa5de71494bf05
#. default-sha256: c57695a1b731e704311a73353e9ac9a16509febad45b2c1456e5543b6e2f3006
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_EA5D1A03_3268_4A54_8101_886DD8F3E0E0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫......e⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫......got it?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫.........ill⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫......im⟪k:8⟫"
"⟪k:9⟫............good..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……는, ⟪k:1⟫……됐어? ⟪k:2⟫………를, ⟪k:3⟫……면, ⟪k:4⟫……더 이상……."

#: scenario4:scenario4_6EB564AD_94E5_468B_B345_ED2F871A2E39
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d033285de3d90d8b2debb122faa3e99031b046bdf3f02d306fcf50412191dcd5
#. default-sha256: 0e6d5794cc4ed72e3e40295e103fad96165f5bbadf100fae804ae4f403c31e8e
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_6EB564AD_94E5_468B_B345_ED2F871A2E39"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He was having trouble making out what they were saying, but he could tell it was several "
"men, and they were outside the front door."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그건 잘 들리지 않았지만, ⟪k:1⟫여럿임이 파악되었습니다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫현관 대문 너머에서 ⟪k:4⟫남자"
"들의 목소리가 들린 겁니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_7EC4247B_E5E4_4739_B6F7_7877CE948467
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a8ef60b04657b55f517d0d5cc31c922e15e9122d6799e436b77b2b6a06aaec29
#. default-sha256: 0ecd1a10da50322f805afe2baf8a1e67f7a5f0f6258f99a963fb77804cc6d624
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7EC4247B_E5E4_4739_B6F7_7877CE948467"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The fact that he could hear them at all through the heavy door meant they were probably "
"shouting quite loudly."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫희미하긴 했지만, ⟪k:1⟫문 너머로 이만큼 들리니―― 저 너머에선 ⟪k:2⟫상당히 큰 목소리였을 수도 있"
"겠군요."

#: scenario4:scenario4_15A7E258_72FE_465C_88F0_C2CB7DEE21F5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0f68a5a048f6eced56f49296564a0cce8489ee6a36dfcc6ae8860c05d227c751
#. default-sha256: 31b54adc12e8b28c98d65600e59c1d439b16301d3d9228e49b6b12fab27675af
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_15A7E258_72FE_465C_88F0_C2CB7DEE21F5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………."

#: scenario4:scenario4_5CEEA977_CD91_4C02_B668_368F8D0B8781
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 726c86bf5373963ff527f36acf85e7cb5cd56b4a162a5baced4e50c3faa18d1c
#. default-sha256: d80160d30393e90d0529ec606a51185a38e552b708b75785f862046d827c2d4b
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_5CEEA977_CD91_4C02_B668_368F8D0B8781"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫An indescribable sense of uneasiness came over him. ⟪k:1⟫Dread. ⟪k:2⟫He drew nearer to the "
"door and focused on the voices on the other side."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫미셸 안에선 ⟪k:1⟫형언할 수 없는 불안이 일었습니다. ⟪k:2⟫불길한 예감이 ⟪k:3⟫들었지요. ⟪k:4⟫미"
"셸은 문에 다가가 귀를 댔습니다.⟪k:5⟫"

#: scenario4:scenario4_94A37FCB_0D02_4E7F_831E_711A98040308
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2f5dd45ed001d1bb94cf70947be15b4824f4ab610bf649ee0c0cf4d4a020082c
#. default-sha256: 9aaced05b21f5457e9f7ac906fd99dc77576e2e9cb4e950a4f705eadb11ac792
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_94A37FCB_0D02_4E7F_831E_711A98040308"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫They grew clearer—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫enough for him to make out what the men were saying."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그러자―― 어느 정도 확실하게, ⟪k:1⟫예, ⟪k:2⟫무슨 말을 하는지 파악이 될 만큼까지 ⟪k:3⟫남자들의 "
"목소리가 들렸습니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_DE196966_60D1_4F84_A73A_06CABADD72E2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f2aa0636f0f17a1878c582b6e638f78d8950bab4dc7f733d249a983533113057
#. default-sha256: f3283836858137b19414473f906d89c0069eb9a2fb1c6be74ecee2aaa0c06a05
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_DE196966_60D1_4F84_A73A_06CABADD72E2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Everything’s in place.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫We’re ready to kill this witch now."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫―――마녀를 죽일 준비는 됐지?"

#: scenario4:scenario4_020BB8B6_BA4E_4354_A1E9_8CEC4E825D30
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fbf76a3eccbf31049f45af86eda45b280447de1acf94744ad3d1a95a3fccb631
#. default-sha256: 43a17d1a2193131cc89ab0ae3113fa8b2332317f41b685ec765bbf0c84f5931a
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_020BB8B6_BA4E_4354_A1E9_8CEC4E825D30"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫This is definitely the place.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫That half-dead bandit said she was in this mansion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫틀림없이 여기야……, ⟪k:1⟫그 다 죽어 가던 도적이 말한 곳은 ⟪k:2⟫이 저택이었어."

#: scenario4:scenario4_F5E94AA9_A9AA_4E9A_A20B_D8B3B8954BB6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b01aa6368f0a5601e91f6222dbe014167212bfafd98fe5cf7e4b65329771cc97
#. default-sha256: e5f149a15494c767513ba685b2e23f87aedb35591c658ceadb2534a2a9a76a28
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_F5E94AA9_A9AA_4E9A_A20B_D8B3B8954BB6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Listen well. No matter what we find in there, we kill it.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It could be a child for "
"all I care—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫that doesn’t change anything."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫잘 들어, ⟪k:1⟫누가 있으면 ⟪k:2⟫아이라도 죽여야 해."

#: scenario4:scenario4_D8BD9768_36BB_40C7_BE0E_01A88DBA775F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ae9643c766eed3cdffc04fb94c9d8352b6b30ac8884584507c03c4a7de48c37b
#. default-sha256: 2013d6972ed286bf3ade0f5b509ea601c52ce534670dde3258b66b82ffdfcf24
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_D8BD9768_36BB_40C7_BE0E_01A88DBA775F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Kill the witch..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫마녀를 죽여라……."

#: scenario4:scenario4_E6DBC15F_E0F2_4941_B4B3_FB7674C65739
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b557a3efd3a40215f8d02e3e624726c34a1de2a6e7ed8837d19ce1b109ebece2
#. default-sha256: 4e3ba7493af390977246d8399e3fe6cfffc0e8fc11b2bb0e4da31c4b73bcfabd
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_E6DBC15F_E0F2_4941_B4B3_FB7674C65739"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Kill the witch! Kill the witch! Kill the witch!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫마녀를 죽여라! ⟪k:1⟫마녀를 죽여라! ⟪k:2⟫마녀를 죽여라!"

#: scenario4:scenario4_2CB8A8EE_8568_44A3_ADA7_4EB7FB5ED8F5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 580dba5606da370724eeda2ec51ae71953c0e184d3b121e0a9c2a7cea40ffb90
#. default-sha256: 4e06f542d9ee1332516c59802b3efa70af17e8ad249c29fe05c3c880592594d5
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_2CB8A8EE_8568_44A3_ADA7_4EB7FB5ED8F5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫—!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫―――!!"

#: scenario4:scenario4_6E7CDC7B_C369_47C1_BA22_A4E17465AAA1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fe7ff1b6f26bea3118eea43b8bc7a60cb8c02c6de2be09df80e0c8be36e9d4cd
#. default-sha256: c675cce43250e6a87375edf40116779aa5399bc1d2ffd59c4f2be19563a47110
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_6E7CDC7B_C369_47C1_BA22_A4E17465AAA1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What he heard beyond the door was a group of men shouting for the death of the witch."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫들리는 말은 ⟪k:1⟫살기 넘치는 발언. ⟪k:2⟫모든 이가 ⟪k:3⟫「마녀를 죽여라」란 말을 했습니다……."

#: scenario4:scenario4_A690B82C_4F7D_4B0F_9AD2_462D3342E8CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 12ff584247fb2c43645b5ecd2f2c814e8b76218ebb41015e021a4becf8dcb180
#. default-sha256: 8be957da4d039a3b46eaac38667b50cf8f63749c3b729740044f10b78e1fe467
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_A690B82C_4F7D_4B0F_9AD2_462D3342E8CD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫In that moment, Michel regretted his decision to let the bandit go free and not watch over "
"him until the moment of his demise."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫미셸은 그 순간, ⟪k:1⟫후회가 들었을 겁니다. ⟪k:2⟫그때 ⟪k:3⟫그 무법자의 죽음을 확인하지 않은 점"
"에요."

#: scenario4:scenario4_3245971D_8FCA_4EC9_8C19_3F353B987522
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3a564bb2b96e58b40877378c3ab93edec4c81b4735f1749abd65baaa2fdb42c2
#. default-sha256: eb22a8ba4f875e691047f6107a1e2f56c9edf34597a1de408e2be2485d92139c
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_3245971D_8FCA_4EC9_8C19_3F353B987522"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He must have made his way down to the village in search of help, where he revealed what he "
"had found at the mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫아마 죽어 가던 무법자는 ⟪k:1⟫도움을 청하려고 마을로 갔을 겁니다. ⟪k:2⟫거기서 ⟪k:3⟫저택 이야기"
"를 한 것이겠지요……."

#: scenario4:scenario4_F047AE0F_CCB8_4BDB_AC49_0FD8AD283747
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b4f9ae0a5c91feb7db8f6251f68aa552ae1182f7f254ef1ad46569b2258fa048
#. default-sha256: 83ef3e0acefdfe2cb2a7a0c7f5d1b3a7d97b90a98b8ec390b02a77c504424623
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_F047AE0F_CCB8_4BDB_AC49_0FD8AD283747"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Dammit!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……크윽……!"

#: scenario4:scenario4_54F65A8D_97D4_464B_8D56_5B38582F256D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7ca78c36ab1588e2dc746c1e0f1cb30cf00240ea19c789d1125a4707be37d49b
#. default-sha256: 7218dfdf43880b0656ccb6fe7faaafa4d0de9b5d8ebfd916b5fbc03beb7ca3e8
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_54F65A8D_97D4_464B_8D56_5B38582F256D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But it was too late.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Regret would solve nothing."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하지만―― 이미 늦었습니다. ⟪k:1⟫모든 것이."

#: scenario4:scenario4_51142D17_A574_4A28_9DD0_1458CF035845
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
