msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_181FDD0D_E253_466B_A870_811424899C19"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He was helpless to do anything. ⟪k:1⟫The gears of his fate had locked him onto a path of "
"tragedy and were turning mercilessly onward."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그 모든 게 ⟪k:1⟫이미 늦은 상태였지요. ⟪k:2⟫톱니바퀴가 돌고 ⟪k:3⟫돌아 ⟪k:4⟫최악의 형태로 맞물"
"렸으니까요."

#: scenario4:scenario4_61896865_B55F_4F1C_9610_108D53707C5A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ac830bbdb8b138937657153634329a0a06695bdab024784cd106a6e84237f49f
