msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_84535F4E_8D18_4A6A_86E3_3EDAD62B1681"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The men had begun trying to break down the door with what sounded like a battering ram."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫대문 너머에서 ⟪k:1⟫남자들이 문을 공격하기 시작했습니다. ⟪k:2⟫아마 여럿이서 큰 통나무를 들고 "
"⟪k:3⟫돌진했을 겁니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_1230153D_43C4_4FEA_8CE0_A1C65A1979CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 872b05b6ff29413a5ab14e50538587f097670aa3f391d7efa111e6b0bc91d548
