msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_1230153D_43C4_4FEA_8CE0_A1C65A1979CD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫While the first strike was not enough to breach the barrier, it was still quite powerful. "
"⟪k:1⟫He was certain it would not hold for long."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫일격으로 뚫리진 않았으나, ⟪k:1⟫그 충격은 강력했습니다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫……오래는 못 가는 상태. ⟪k:4⟫"
"그걸 ⟪k:5⟫확신할 만큼이나요."

#: scenario4:scenario4_D6D105A4_277E_41F4_8A3B_30897AE31E4E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1ad91030df8c1a35b193877ac56acd44fcb0934b7fe0f852408a931ff4585215
