msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_D6D105A4_277E_41F4_8A3B_30897AE31E4E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Michel’s mind raced.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Was there anything he could do about this predicament?⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫How could he escape from the corner he had been backed into?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫미셸은 고심했습니다. ⟪k:1⟫이 상황을 타개할 방법은? ⟪k:2⟫어떡해야 궁지에서 벗어날 수 있는가?"

#: scenario4:scenario4_7D24824D_4075_4CB2_940D_D3C78DB81971
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b0315e3a7a7a8b4943ce0bdcd31db0087192aa5dc51d04bfa6e5dc62a18413b0
#. default-sha256: 3fca0db4851093ab69ce4d766acf72b23c987b516709e648dcbeffa5a9e8fc9f
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7D24824D_4075_4CB2_940D_D3C78DB81971"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Despite his possessing inhuman powers, he would be powerless against a full mob of adult men."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫하지만―― 아무리 미셸이 인간 같지 않은 힘을 가졌어도, ⟪k:1⟫성인 남자 여럿이 몰려온 상황에선 "
"⟪k:2⟫뾰족한 수가 없었습니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_889C62FA_412E_4E4C_AC7D_ED5CE742BFB1
