msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……미셸……."

#: scenario4:scenario4_A8C24649_4B7C_49D1_B818_19BB72905BD8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fc369225a595610f8ddc11beb526261180890239f996142b043301b385f409d3
