msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_A8C24649_4B7C_49D1_B818_19BB72905BD8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫A weak voice came from behind him. ⟪k:1⟫Aghast, he spun around to find the White-Haired Girl "
"stumbling toward him. She breathed heavily, leaning against columns for support."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그럴 때 ⟪k:1⟫미셸이 들은 건 ⟪k:2⟫소녀의 힘없는 목소리였습니다. ⟪k:3⟫화들짝 놀라 뒤를 돌아보"
"니, ⟪k:4⟫소녀가 헐떡이면서 ⟪k:5⟫기둥을 짚고 이리로 오고 있었습니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_1A67E40E_67ED_4652_AD3B_82880A30B4E1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7178a54fd5931551f4a8b2b5cefda693b27b088676ce6c28f759e16e1832b342
