msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What are you doing out here?!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You’ll only worsen your condition by exerting "
"yourself!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫여기에 ⟪k:1⟫왜……! ⟪k:2⟫일어서 있으면 ⟪k:3⟫몸 상태가 악화되잖습니까……!"

