msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫It seems... ⟪k:4⟫that I...⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫have brought all my misfortune upon you..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫……아아……, ⟪k:4⟫……제가……⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫모든 불행을 일으켰군요……."

#: scenario4:scenario4_0CD1A1CD_D5E7_4012_B586_028CFD0EC441
