#: scenario4:scenario4_CD777C6E_E23C_4272_ADBF_7B8D043C5C53
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8410809c9e83e924cead2123cf4c148e5efd7dce78e728164aa0ba3a623ea671
