msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If I hadn’t come here, this never would have happened...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You never would have been "
"in any danger..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫제가 여기 안 왔으면 ⟪k:1⟫이렇겐 안 됐을 거예요…….⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫당신을 해치는 건 ⟪k:4⟫없었을 거예"
"요……."

#: scenario4:scenario4_FD8AEC04_DA05_4C48_AB9B_4A67C6E5A670
