msgid "⟪k:0⟫Please, Michel, hand me over to the men outside."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫미셸, ⟪k:1⟫부탁드릴게요.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫……저를, ⟪k:4⟫저 사람들에게 바치세요."

#: scenario4:scenario4_A9B2C64A_9F0A_4CEC_9360_6A4D8E2634CC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
