msgstr "⟪k:0⟫못 합니다! ⟪k:1⟫……그런 요구를 ⟪k:2⟫어떻게 받아들이란 겁니까……!"

#: scenario4:scenario4_DD34968C_659C_4176_BB60_7958CBF3E2F9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 90f4c3d213b16a626791fc6973ca82c4451cdb2f30bdad4d90839728fad4f00e
