msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫They’re here for the witch, aren’t they?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I’m guessing they’re the same people who "
"were chasing me before."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫하지만―― ⟪k:1⟫저 사람들은 마녀를 찾는 거죠?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫분명 ⟪k:4⟫저를 쫓던 사람들일 거예요."

#: scenario4:scenario4_9E2ADFD8_DB04_43F8_BCE0_6F794B7712B8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7b97b3354d4c1312fe67795f77476b3f11d51231298fb44061b90a906e82c5fa
