msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_9E2ADFD8_DB04_43F8_BCE0_6F794B7712B8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The village had a poor harvest this year, I hear.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Like the village in the legend."
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫And they believe it’s the witch’s curse..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫……전승처럼……, ⟪k:1⟫그 마을은 ⟪k:2⟫흉작을 겪는 중인 것 같았어요. ⟪k:3⟫그걸 ⟪k:4⟫마녀의 저주로 "
"여긴 거죠……."

#: scenario4:scenario4_0AF28E73_4346_49E0_86D5_8F5C316892B5
